  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 132,
    "summary": "A messianic psalm—Of the fruit of David’s loins will the Lord set One upon His throne—The Lord will bless Zion, and her Saints will shout for joy.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Lord, remember David, and all his afflictions:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 14,
            "text": "2 Chr. 6:42."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 25
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "How he sware unto the Lord, and vowed unto the mighty God of Jacob;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "TG Vow."
          },
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 57,
            "text": "Isa. 49:26."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 31
          },
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 57
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Surely I will not come into the tabernacle of my house, nor go up into my bed;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I will not give sleep to mine eyes, or slumber to mine eyelids,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 38
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Until I find out a place for the Lord, an habitation for the mighty God of Jacob.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 42,
            "end": 52,
            "text": "1 Chr. 22:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 71
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lo, we heard of it at Ephratah: we found it in the fields of the wood.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 69,
            "text": "HEB Yaʼar (a place)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "We will go into his tabernacles: we will worship at his footstool.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Arise, O Lord, into thy rest; thou, and the ark of thy strength.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let thy priests be clothed with righteousness; and let thy saints shout for joy.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "TG Priesthood, Magnifying Callings within."
          },
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 45,
            "text": "TG Righteousness."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For thy servant David’s sake turn not away the face of thine anointed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The Lord hath sworn in truth unto David; he will not turn from it; Of the fruit of thy body will I set upon thy throne.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "Luke 1:55 (54–55); Gal. 3:16."
          },
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 79,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Davidic Descent of."
          },
          {
            "start": 112,
            "end": 118,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Millennial Reign."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 22
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "If thy children will keep my covenant and my testimony that I shall teach them, their children shall also sit upon thy throne for evermore.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 7,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 2:4."
          },
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "D&C 90:24."
          },
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 54,
            "text": "TG Testimony."
          },
          {
            "start": 119,
            "end": 125,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 9:5."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the Lord hath chosen Zion; he hath desired it for his habitation.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "TG Zion."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 49
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "This is my rest for ever: here will I dwell; for I have desired it.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 5,
            "end": 7
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I will abundantly bless her provision: I will satisfy her poor with bread.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "D&C 58:8 (8–11)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I will also clothe her priests with salvation: and her saints shall shout aloud for joy.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "Isa. 61:10."
          },
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 73,
            "text": "D&C 109:80."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "There will I make the horn of David to bud: I have ordained a lamp for mine anointed.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Prophecies about."
          },
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "TG Jesus Christ, Davidic Descent of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "His enemies will I clothe with shame: but upon himself shall his crown flourish.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 36,
            "text": "TG Shame."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "nextChapterId": "psalms133",
  "prevChapterId": "psalms131",
